#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:1
#: 8d140f43e57d4994b5d746d353fe564e
msgid "Economic Efficiency When Prices Are Observed"
msgstr "观测到价格时的经济效率"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:3
#: a31ccfd2a8b840dd8a7f446dbe941e2c
msgid ""
"A production frontier describes what an organization could attain with the "
"technology represented in the data. It does not, by itself, identify the "
"economically preferred plan. Prices make that comparison possible, but only "
"after management has said which parts of the current operation are "
"commitments and which parts can change."
msgstr "生产前沿描述组织在数据所代表的技术下能够实现什么，却不能单独识别经济上更受偏好的方案。价格使这种比较成为可能，但管理层必须先说明当前经营活动中哪些部分是必须履行的承诺，哪些部分可以改变。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:8
#: bfac1dddb8b54b9ba72f50fa7b9db19d
msgid ""
"A hospital may have to deliver a fixed bundle of services and seek the least"
" costly way to do so. A university may have fixed staff and facilities and "
"ask which mix of teaching and research creates the most value. A farm or "
"factory with discretion over both resources and products may instead seek "
"the largest operating surplus. These are not different names for one "
"efficiency score. They are, respectively, cost, revenue, and profit "
"decisions."
msgstr "医院可能必须提供固定的服务组合，并寻找成本最低的实现方式。大学可能已经确定人员与设施，想知道怎样组合教学和科研才能创造最大价值。能够同时调整资源和产品的农场或工厂，则可能追求最大的经营盈余。成本、收益和利润决策并不是同一个效率得分的不同名称。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:15
#: 1e3cc53fc68a407089587067b4b88f08
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This chapter develops those decisions as one production-economic family and "
"shows how technical and allocative performance fit together. A short final "
"bridge connects a declared directional programme to the profit gap without "
"turning that bridge into a fourth economic objective. The distinction "
"between technical and allocative performance originates in Farrell's account"
" of productive efficiency {cite:p}`farrell1957`; cost, revenue, profit, and "
"distance measures can then be understood within a common technology-and-"
"prices framework {cite:p}`fare1985`."
msgstr ""
"本章把这些决策作为一个统一的生产经济学模型族来讨论，并说明技术绩效与配置绩效如何结合。结尾的一座短桥把一套声明的方向性方案与利润缺口联系起来，但不会把这座桥变成第四种经济目标。技术绩效与配置绩效的区别源于"
" Farrell 的生产效率账户 {cite:p}`farrell1957`；成本、收益、利润和距离测度随后可以置于共同的技术—价格框架中理解 "
"{cite:p}`fare1985`。"

