#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:57
#: a6999ab951e74967a855973e7acda645
msgid ""
"The commitment is the key to interpretation. A unit can be cost efficient "
"for its current output obligation yet have a large profit gap because "
"another scale or output portfolio would be more valuable. It can also use "
"its existing capacity well while purchasing an unnecessarily expensive input"
" mix. Prices do not alter technical feasibility; they rank feasible plans. A"
" change in relative prices can therefore change the preferred benchmark even"
" when the production frontier is unchanged."
msgstr "承诺是解释的关键。一个组织可以在履行当前产出义务的条件下成本有效，却仍有很大利润缺口，因为另一经营规模或产出组合更有价值。它也可能充分利用现有产能，却购买了成本不必要地高的投入组合。价格不改变技术可行性，而是在可行方案之间排序。因此，即使生产前沿不变，相对价格变化也可能改变首选标杆。"

