#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:91
#: 92849fabc32642c880dcec13d223eef2
msgid ""
"We use the variable-returns-to-scale (VRS) convex technology generated by A"
"--D, with ordinary free disposal. A benchmark may be an observed plan or a "
"convex combination of plans. Plan D is the main management case. Its "
"observed account is weak, but each model will explain that weakness against "
"a different, decision-relevant alternative. Plans A and C will show why "
"technical, conditional economic, and joint profit performance cannot be "
"treated as interchangeable labels."
msgstr ""
"本章使用由 A--D 生成、具有普通自由处置性的规模报酬可变（VRS）凸技术。标杆可以是一个观测方案，也可以是多个方案的凸组合。方案 D "
"是主要管理案例：其观测账户表现较弱，但每个模型都会用一个不同且与决策相关的替代方案解释这种不足。方案 A 和 C "
"则说明，为何技术绩效、条件经济绩效和联合利润绩效不能作为可以互换的标签。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:98
#: 671127cf4f5c49a6ab8f92a548cbb16c
msgid ""
"Observed Plan D branches to minimum-cost, maximum-revenue, and maximum-"
"profit decisions, followed by a directional bridge that values one declared "
"joint improvement package"
msgstr "观测方案 D 分别通往最低成本、最大收益和最大利润决策，再通过一座方向性桥梁评价一套声明的联合改进方案"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:103
#: 193322002c884ddca785713df96abb0b
msgid ""
"Holding the observations fixed makes the economic commitments visible. The "
"first three branches are economic decisions; the fourth only interprets part"
" of the profit gap through a declared operating programme."
msgstr "保持观测值不变，可以清楚看见各种经济承诺。前三个分支是经济决策；第四个分支只通过一套声明的经营方案解释利润缺口的一部分。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:108
#: 9f4cae8438ad4ce1ad0cb93ba3292780
msgid "Cost: protect the service commitment"
msgstr "成本：保障服务承诺"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:110
#: c8061ca743924b4da106b3fb7190473f
msgid ""
"Cost analysis is appropriate when the organization must deliver at least its"
" observed outputs but can adjust the resources used. Examples include a "
"contracted production volume, a regulated service obligation, or a fixed "
"order book."
msgstr "当组织必须至少提供观测产出，但可以调整资源使用时，适合进行成本分析。典型情形包括合同约定的生产量、监管规定的服务义务或固定订单。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:114
#: 94ab605738be46cf978e2a1e9d383c1a
msgid ""
"For unit $o$, let $X$ and $Y$ collect the reference inputs and outputs. "
"Minimum attainable cost is"
msgstr "对单元 $o$，令 $X$ 和 $Y$ 汇集参照投入与产出。最低可实现成本为"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:117
#: 0842aba1d0f8430ca46b6a8cee6eb39c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"C_o^*(w_o,y_o)\n"
"=\\min_{\\lambda}\\quad & w_o^\\top X\\lambda\\\\\n"
"\\text{s.t.}\\quad\n"
"&Y\\lambda\\ge y_o,\\\\\n"
"&\\lambda\\ge0,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"C_o^*(w_o,y_o)\n"
"=\\min_{\\lambda}\\quad & w_o^\\top X\\lambda\\\\\n"
"\\text{约束条件}\\quad\n"
"&Y\\lambda\\ge y_o,\\\\\n"
"&\\lambda\\ge0,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:127
#: 9216e78127cd4670b3aa55a418dc6fad
msgid ""
"with the declared returns-to-scale restriction. Under VRS, $\\mathbf "
"1^\\top\\lambda=1$; under constant returns to scale (CRS), that equality is "
"absent. The chosen activity is the attainable plan that satisfies the output"
" commitment at the lowest bill, not necessarily the physically nearest plan."
msgstr ""
"并附加声明的规模报酬约束。VRS 下有 $\\mathbf "
"1^\\top\\lambda=1$；规模报酬不变（CRS）下则没有这项等式。所选生产活动是在满足产出承诺的可实现方案中账单最低者，不一定是物理数量上最近的方案。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:132
#: 8fb2b2d849e24c80abc38e5bacf25175
msgid "Two reports serve different purposes:"
msgstr "两种报告服务于不同目的："

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:134
#: 7b10916bc7d544a79cdd214ab8c0efcd
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"CE_o=\\frac{C_o^*}{C_o},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"G_o^C=C_o-C_o^*.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"CE_o=\\frac{C_o^*}{C_o},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"G_o^C=C_o-C_o^*.\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:140
#: badc31fb480a45d78329d49df664d196
msgid ""
"Cost efficiency $CE_o$ is a dimensionless ratio, with one best for a "
"positive-price, self-inclusive technology. The cost gap $G_o^C$ expresses "
"the same opportunity in money units and is often more useful for budgeting."
msgstr ""
"成本效率 $CE_o$ 是无量纲比率；在价格为正、且包含被评价单元自身的技术下，1 为最优值。成本缺口 $G_o^C$ "
"用货币单位表达同一机会，通常更便于预算管理。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:144
#: 5d2d69ac80144e27b5313e5d115a8560
msgid "Technical and allocative sources of a cost gap"
msgstr "成本缺口的技术来源与配置来源"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:146
#: e60c05f3c56d4847a0c4fa24c6d2cb95
msgid ""
"An input-oriented Farrell model holds outputs fixed and contracts the "
"observed input bundle in common proportion. Let its input technical "
"efficiency be $TE_o^I=\\theta_o$. Cost allocative efficiency is "
"conventionally"
msgstr ""
"投入导向 Farrell 模型保持产出不变，并按共同百分比压缩观测投入组合。记其投入技术效率为 "
"$TE_o^I=\\theta_o$。成本配置效率通常定义为"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:150
#: ed9bd11d232947c18c9eb1ee2587149d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"AE_o^C=\\frac{CE_o}{TE_o^I},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"CE_o=TE_o^I AE_o^C.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"AE_o^C=\\frac{CE_o}{TE_o^I},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"CE_o=TE_o^I AE_o^C.\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:156
#: 00b4e7bc2c69426c87017a268111138d
msgid ""
"The first component values the opportunity to reduce the existing resource "
"bundle proportionally. The second records the remaining cost advantage when "
"the input mix may respond to relative prices. The same distinction can be "
"written as a monetary account:"
msgstr "第一项评价按比例减少现有资源组合的机会；第二项记录投入组合可以响应相对价格时剩余的成本优势。同一区别也可以写成货币账户："

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:161
#: 5807dbf83d584e909cfe4758934ff79c
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\underbrace{C_o-C_o^*}_{\\text{total cost opportunity}}\n"
"=\n"
"\\underbrace{C_o-\\theta_oC_o}_{\\text{proportional resource saving}}\n"
"+\n"
"\\underbrace{\\theta_oC_o-C_o^*}_{\\text{remaining cost saving}}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\underbrace{C_o-C_o^*}_{\\text{总成本节约空间}}\n"
"=\n"
"\\underbrace{C_o-\\theta_oC_o}_{\\text{比例性资源节约}}\n"
"+\n"
"\\underbrace{\\theta_oC_o-C_o^*}_{\\text{剩余成本节约}}.\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:169
#: 13a0c1152f644a82b0480ba02ddf9b18
msgid ""
"The word *allocative* requires care. If the radial technical plan retains "
"input slacks, the remaining cost component can combine non-proportional "
"resource savings with price-responsive input substitution. An output surplus"
" does not enter the input bill directly, although it prevents the radial "
"plan from supporting an unconditional strong-efficiency claim. The identity "
"remains exact, but the second component should not automatically be "
"interpreted as purchasing skill."
msgstr "*配置*一词需要谨慎。如果径向技术方案仍有投入松弛量，剩余成本分量就可能同时包含非比例资源节约和响应价格的投入替代。产出富余不会直接进入投入账单，但会使径向方案不能支持无条件强效率主张。恒等式仍然精确，却不能自动把第二项解释为采购能力。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:176
#: 347921cf405c4041a570ffd4e6d7692c
msgid ""
"For Plan D, the least-cost activity is $0.25B+0.75C$. It uses 3.5 units of "
"the resource and produces $(4.75,2)$, so it satisfies D's service commitment"
" at a cost of 7. Therefore"
msgstr ""
"对方案 D，最低成本生产活动为 $0.25B+0.75C$。它使用 3.5 单位资源，生产 $(4.75,2)$，因而以成本 7 满足 D "
"的服务承诺。因此"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:180
#: 701c8ee61e484723a0a78159cda0dc05
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"CE_D=\\frac{7}{12}\\approx0.583,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"G_D^C=12-7=5.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"CE_D=\\frac{7}{12}\\approx0.583,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"G_D^C=12-7=5.\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:186
#: 62d20c6088c5416b95c0190da66709f7
msgid ""
"With only one input there is no composition to change, so $TE_D^I=7/12$ and "
"$AE_D^C=1$. This does not make D a good operation overall. It says that its "
"five-unit cost opportunity is fully explained by resource contraction in "
"this one-input example. Nor must the least-cost activity reproduce outputs "
"exactly: free disposal permits it to exceed the commitment for standard "
"services."
msgstr ""
"这里只有一项投入，无法改变投入构成，所以 $TE_D^I=7/12$、$AE_D^C=1$。这并不表示 D "
"的整体经营良好；它只说明在这个单投入例子中，五单位成本机会全部由资源压缩解释。最低成本生产活动也不必精确复制产出：自由处置性允许其标准服务超过承诺量。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:192
#: 5b1b181461c143d0bc219689bb6ad7fb
msgid "Revenue: use the available capacity well"
msgstr "收益：充分利用现有产能"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:194
#: 42c5f54e8fec4e6d9fd69008fefd8fee
msgid ""
"Revenue analysis treats the observed input vector as the resource envelope "
"and asks which feasible output quantities and mix create the greatest value "
"at $p_o$:"
msgstr "收益分析把观测投入向量视为资源限额，考察在 $p_o$ 下哪种可行产出数量与组合能够创造最大价值："

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:197
#: 8b19d502a8b54302ada85b70764cf826
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"R_o^*(p_o,x_o)\n"
"=\\max_{\\lambda}\\quad & p_o^\\top Y\\lambda\\\\\n"
"\\text{s.t.}\\quad\n"
"&X\\lambda\\le x_o,\\\\\n"
"&\\lambda\\ge0,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"R_o^*(p_o,x_o)\n"
"=\\max_{\\lambda}\\quad & p_o^\\top Y\\lambda\\\\\n"
"\\text{约束条件}\\quad\n"
"&X\\lambda\\le x_o,\\\\\n"
"&\\lambda\\ge0,\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:207
#: c4c065ebd84843a48fc2863d2ef815dd
msgid ""
"again with the chosen returns-to-scale restriction. Revenue efficiency and "
"its money-valued gap are"
msgstr "同样附加所选规模报酬约束。收益效率及其货币价值缺口为"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:210
#: aaaee335b0ab46f1b8bbcb9ef3d98004
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"RE_o=\\frac{R_o}{R_o^*},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"G_o^R=R_o^*-R_o.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"RE_o=\\frac{R_o}{R_o^*},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"G_o^R=R_o^*-R_o.\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:216
#: 95c02c5339c4473dafbe31a94421beb4
msgid ""
"A revenue ratio of 0.70 means that the observed portfolio earns 70 percent "
"of the largest revenue supported by the same input envelope. That "
"interpretation assumes the supplied prices remain meaningful for the "
"additional outputs. Demand limits, volume-sensitive prices, quotas, and "
"changing quality can otherwise make the counterfactual commercially "
"unrealistic."
msgstr ""
"收益比率 0.70 表示，观测产出组合获得了同一投入限额能够支持的最大收益的 "
"70%。这种解释假定所给价格对新增产出仍有意义；否则，需求限制、随产量变化的价格、配额和质量变化都可能使反事实在商业上不现实。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:222
#: 777cddb12f1c4312bed1dc8b4950fafb
msgid ""
"Let $\\phi_o\\ge1$ be the greatest common-proportion expansion of observed "
"desirable outputs supported by the input envelope. On a higher-is-better "
"scale, $TE_o^O=1/\\phi_o$, and"
msgstr ""
"令 $\\phi_o\\ge1$ 表示在投入限额下，观测合意产出能够实现的最大共同比例扩张。转换到越高越好的尺度，有 "
"$TE_o^O=1/\\phi_o$，且"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:226
#: 96fb6f08370745069d3a5465be6da539
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"AE_o^R=\\frac{RE_o}{TE_o^O},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"RE_o=TE_o^OAE_o^R.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"AE_o^R=\\frac{RE_o}{TE_o^O},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"RE_o=TE_o^OAE_o^R.\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:232
#: cd1925061e3e4bc586f27c6bf4077931
msgid ""
"$TE_o^O$ asks whether more of the existing output bundle could be delivered;"
" $AE_o^R$ records the remaining advantage of changing its composition in "
"response to output values. If the radial plan retains desirable-output "
"slacks, the remaining revenue component can combine non-proportional service"
" gains with price-responsive output reallocation. An input saving does not "
"enter the revenue account directly, although it still prevents an "
"unconditional strong-efficiency conclusion."
msgstr ""
"$TE_o^O$ 问的是现有产出组合能否提供更多；$AE_o^R$ "
"记录产出组合响应产出价值后剩余的优势。如果径向方案仍有合意产出松弛量，剩余收益分量就可能同时包含非比例服务增加和响应价格的产出重新配置。投入节约不会直接进入收益账户，但仍使无条件强效率结论不能成立。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:239
#: a5f9bd4278004cf991f122fc700f699f
msgid ""
"Plan D earns 19 with six units of resource. Plan B uses only five units and "
"earns 37, so"
msgstr "方案 D 使用 6 单位资源，获得收益 19。方案 B 只使用 5 单位资源，却获得收益 37，所以"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:242
#: 67ab3653f9e34bb9afcba4ce74d9212c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"RE_D=\\frac{19}{37}\\approx0.514,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"G_D^R=37-19=18.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"RE_D=\\frac{19}{37}\\approx0.514,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"G_D^R=37-19=18.\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:248
#: d50db93cc27844a4832d7871d31bc9b9
msgid ""
"The greatest proportional expansion of D's observed output mix is "
"$\\phi_D=22/13$, giving"
msgstr "D 的观测产出组合最大同比例扩张为 $\\phi_D=22/13$，得到"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:251
#: 4c45228ccc8d4184bcfe81e320d3cc5b
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"TE_D^O=\\frac{13}{22}\\approx0.591,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"AE_D^R\n"
"=\\frac{19/37}{13/22}\n"
"=\\frac{418}{481}\n"
"\\approx0.869.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"TE_D^O=\\frac{13}{22}\\approx0.591,\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"AE_D^R\n"
"=\\frac{19/37}{13/22}\n"
"=\\frac{418}{481}\n"
"\\approx0.869.\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:260
#: 27a96fd8127f4384b4e073c3ebeb5f3d
msgid ""
"Part of D's revenue shortfall is thus associated with delivering too little "
"from its resource envelope; another part is associated with its low-value "
"output mix. Plan A provides the converse lesson. It cannot expand both "
"outputs proportionally, so $TE_A^O=1$, yet $0.5B+0.5C$ uses the same input "
"and earns 28.5 rather than 28. Hence"
msgstr ""
"因此，D 的一部分收益不足与其资源限额内提供的数量过少有关，另一部分则与低价值产出组合有关。方案 A 提供相反的教训：它不能同时按比例扩张两项产出，所以"
" $TE_A^O=1$；但 $0.5B+0.5C$ 使用同样投入，收益为 28.5，而不是 28。因此"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:265
#: e57aca2e0852491f84ed462ff9a9cfe1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"RE_A=AE_A^R=\\frac{28}{28.5}=\\frac{56}{57}<1.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"RE_A=AE_A^R=\\frac{28}{28.5}=\\frac{56}{57}<1.\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:269
#: 5741a950d68146cc9c6af8afb55dc081
msgid ""
"A can be technically efficient for proportional output expansion without "
"being revenue maximizing."
msgstr "A 可以在产出同比例扩张问题上技术有效，却没有实现收益最大化。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:272
#: 1992ac1004a04883add93616c020ca6f
msgid "Profit: choose the operating plan jointly"
msgstr "利润：联合选择经营方案"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:274
#: 333caaeeb3684f3b82f09db6bbfc443f
msgid ""
"Cost and revenue analysis protect one side of the observed operation. Profit"
" analysis removes both conditional commitments and asks which attainable "
"input--output plan creates the largest difference between revenue and cost. "
"For the VRS technology,"
msgstr "成本分析与收益分析都保障观测经营方案的一侧。利润分析取消这两项条件性承诺，考察哪个可实现投入—产出方案能使收益与成本之差最大。对于 VRS 技术，"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:278
#: dbbf6bd7e9f6430db2c93c4af50f82a5
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Pi_o^*(w_o,p_o)\n"
"=\\max_{\\lambda}\\quad\n"
"&p_o^\\top Y\\lambda-w_o^\\top X\\lambda\\\\\n"
"\\text{s.t.}\\quad\n"
"&\\mathbf 1^\\top\\lambda=1,\\\\\n"
"&\\lambda\\ge0.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\begin{aligned}\n"
"\\Pi_o^*(w_o,p_o)\n"
"=\\max_{\\lambda}\\quad\n"
"&p_o^\\top Y\\lambda-w_o^\\top X\\lambda\\\\\n"
"\\text{约束条件}\\quad\n"
"&\\mathbf 1^\\top\\lambda=1,\\\\\n"
"&\\lambda\\ge0.\n"
"\\end{aligned}\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:289
#: d5e4fa201c294148b4f873da38dabab7
msgid "The natural measure of profit inefficiency is the raw gap"
msgstr "利润无效率最自然的测度是原始缺口"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:291
#: c638d6e10880497f9a4a780eca013347
msgid ""
"\n"
"G_o^\\Pi=\\Pi_o^*-\\Pi_o.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"G_o^\\Pi=\\Pi_o^*-\\Pi_o.\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:295
#: d836c45bba424b569666422cc4830738
msgid ""
"Profit is already a difference between two accounts. Observed or maximum "
"profit can be zero or negative, so a ratio can become undefined or reverse "
"the economic ranking. The raw gap remains meaningful: it is the additional "
"profit available within the declared technology and at the supplied prices."
msgstr "利润本身已经是两个账户之差。观测利润或最大利润可能为零或负值，此时比率可能无定义，或颠倒经济排序。原始缺口仍有意义：它是在声明技术与所给价格下可以获得的额外利润。"

