#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:306
#: c9b4beb3f71349be8abade6d3fd2167a
msgid "In the example, Plan B maximizes profit:"
msgstr "本例中，方案 B 实现利润最大化："

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:308
#: f42bb51cb6004cd39e33e235a9b5d9c5
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Pi^*=\\max\\{20,27,14,7\\}=27,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\Pi^*=\\max\\{20,27,14,7\\}=27,\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:312
#: 759529b318e84bdf8898eb6be1261039
msgid ""
"so the gaps for A--D are $(7,0,13,20)$. Plan D has a twenty-unit profit "
"opportunity. Plan C illustrates why this is not redundant with the "
"conditional models. It is both cost efficient for its output commitment and "
"revenue efficient within its three-unit input envelope, but it has a profit "
"gap of 13 because profit maximization permits a different scale and service "
"portfolio. “Best conditional on the current operation” is not the same as "
"“best attainable operation at these prices.”"
msgstr ""
"所以 A--D 的缺口为 $(7,0,13,20)$。方案 D 存在 20 单位利润机会。方案 C "
"说明为何利润分析并非条件模型的重复：对于自身产出承诺，它成本有效；在三单位投入限额内，它也收益有效；但它仍有 13 "
"的利润缺口，因为利润最大化允许选择不同的规模与服务组合。“在当前经营条件下最优”并不等于“在这些价格下可实现的最优经营方案”。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:319
#: c360e1a4168b49299eb8b9f5f659b01e
msgid "A directional bridge to the profit gap"
msgstr "连接方向性方案与利润缺口的桥梁"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:321
#: 102e79b5ac4f41258b2801dc13c814c3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The profit gap measures the whole economic opportunity. Sometimes management"
" also wants to know how much of that opportunity is represented by a "
"*declared operating programme*. This is where the directional distance "
"function from the preceding chapter meets the price account; it is not a "
"fourth production technology or a parallel management objective "
"{cite:p}`chambers1998,zofio2013profit`."
msgstr ""
"利润缺口衡量完整的经济机会。有时管理层还希望知道，其中有多少由一套*声明的经营方案*所代表。这里，上一章的方向性距离函数与价格账户相遇；它不是第四种生产技术，也不是并列的管理目标"
" {cite:p}`chambers1998,zofio2013profit`。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:327
#: c6beb0e76ad9452db4bb7784350550e1
msgid ""
"Suppose one unit of the programme saves $g_o^x$ inputs and adds $g_o^y$ "
"outputs. If the directional model supports $\\beta_o$ units of that package,"
" prices value one programme unit at"
msgstr "假设一单位方案节约 $g_o^x$ 投入并增加 $g_o^y$ 产出。若方向性模型支持该方案的 $\\beta_o$ 个单位，价格对一单位方案的价值评价为"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:331
#: d6e0b04d6e66424da7d3172536166f7e
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\nu_o=w_o^\\top g_o^x+p_o^\\top g_o^y>0.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\nu_o=w_o^\\top g_o^x+p_o^\\top g_o^y>0.\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:335
#: 321af968962f477dad1a8d90ee1b9e6f
msgid ""
"The feasible programme therefore accounts for $\\nu_o\\beta_o$ of the profit"
" opportunity. Under the same technology, prices, returns to scale, and "
"reference set, that amount cannot exceed the total profit gap. The Nerlovian"
" normalization simply expresses the gap in programme units:"
msgstr ""
"因此，可行方案解释了利润机会中的 "
"$\\nu_o\\beta_o$。在技术、价格、规模报酬和参考集相同的条件下，该数额不能超过总利润缺口。Nerlovian "
"归一化只是用方案单位表达缺口："

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:340
#: f1193749ac1e4c4c9e7243d907b76ccf
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"NI_o:=\\frac{G_o^\\Pi}{\\nu_o}\n"
"=\n"
"\\beta_o+\\frac{G_o^\\Pi-\\nu_o\\beta_o}{\\nu_o}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"NI_o:=\\frac{G_o^\\Pi}{\\nu_o}\n"
"=\n"
"\\beta_o+\\frac{G_o^\\Pi-\\nu_o\\beta_o}{\\nu_o}.\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:346
#: a31aa2ab908f407eaa7b7640a7444f4b
msgid ""
"The residual is the profit opportunity not represented by the selected "
"package. It may reflect a different input mix, output mix, operating scale, "
"or technical changes outside the declared direction; calling it “allocative”"
" does not prove a managerial cause."
msgstr "剩余项是所选方案未能代表的利润机会。它可能反映不同的投入组合、产出组合、经营规模，或声明方向以外的技术变化；把它称为“配置项”并不能证明任何管理原因。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:351
#: 43d3d2d0f5a944f481dad79c1762b1b7
msgid ""
"Some literature calls the normalized quantity *Nerlovian efficiency*. "
"Because $NI_o$ is zero at the profit optimum and rises with foregone profit,"
" this book and DEAPack use *Nerlovian profit inefficiency*. "
"`NerlovianEfficiency` is retained only as a discoverability alias; it does "
"not define another model."
msgstr ""
"部分文献把归一化数量称为 *Nerlovian efficiency*。由于 $NI_o$ 在利润最优点为零，并随放弃的利润增加，本书和 DEAPack"
" 使用 *Nerlovian 利润无效率*。`NerlovianEfficiency` 只作为便于发现的别名保留，并不定义另一个模型。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:356
#: 0ce7eee968404cc1bbfd606cb1ddfc70
msgid ""
"This reconciliation is reported only when both underlying decisions can be "
"rebuilt: the selected activity must attain the stated profit maximum, and "
"the directional activity must actually deliver $\\beta_o$ units of the same "
"declared programme within the same reference technology. A finite optimum "
"without those two economic accounts cannot support the decomposition."
msgstr ""
"只有当两个基础决策都能重构时，才报告这一协调分解：所选生产活动必须达到所述最大利润，方向性生产活动也必须在同一参照技术内实际实现同一声明方案的 "
"$\\beta_o$ 个单位。若缺少这两个经济账户，仅有一个有限最优值不足以支持分解。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:362
#: 3732f14204774162985fe85c6f344c2c
msgid ""
"For Plan D, the package “save one resource unit and add one unit of each "
"service” is worth 10. The directional model supports 1.6 packages, while the"
" full profit gap is 20. Thus the programme represents 16 of the opportunity "
"and 4 remains. This compact bridge is the substantive lesson. Detailed "
"direction-normalization choices and the complete "
"`NerlovianProfitInefficiency` field inventory belong in the DEAPack "
"Documentation."
msgstr ""
"对方案 D，“节约一单位资源并且每项服务各增加一单位”这一方案的价值为 10。方向性模型支持 1.6 份方案，总利润缺口为 20。因此，方案代表其中 "
"16，剩余 4。这座简明桥梁就是核心实质结论。方向归一化的详细选择以及完整的 `NerlovianProfitInefficiency` 字段清单属于 "
"DEAPack Documentation。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:369
#: 09a9e3f670ee427d90c48dcd24af433a
msgid ""
"Current Plan D, its feasible directional operating benchmark, and profit-"
"maximizing Plan B are compared, with the total profit gap divided into the "
"part represented by the declared programme and the remaining price-"
"responsive allocation opportunity"
msgstr "比较当前方案 D、其可行方向性经营标杆和利润最大化方案 B，并把总利润缺口分为声明方案所代表的部分与剩余的价格响应型配置机会"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:374
#: b277f51ad4c14bc894011a198c6d3997
msgid ""
"The same Plan D account in operating quantities and value. The middle plan "
"is the largest feasible multiple of the declared improvement programme; the "
"right-hand plan maximizes profit. The bridge reconciles two counterfactuals "
"and does not prescribe an order in which management must act."
msgstr ""
"用经营数量和价值显示同一个方案 D "
"账户。中间方案是声明改进方案的最大可行倍数，右侧方案实现利润最大化。这座桥协调两个反事实，并不规定管理层必须按何种顺序行动。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:380
#: dc60df9d03de4dc494942a83034d0e43
msgid "Reproduce the account with DEAPack"
msgstr "使用 DEAPack 复现账户"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:382
#: fe427ab601b84827b45fa8c064c220fb
msgid ""
"The core case uses one data object, one price contract, and one VRS "
"technology. Keeping these choices common is what makes the cost, revenue, "
"and profit comparisons coherent."
msgstr "核心案例使用一个数据对象、一项价格契约和一个 VRS 技术。只有保持这些选择一致，成本、收益和利润比较才彼此协调。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:445
#: ad166824517f4f1d8ca6e7802c27a4c1
msgid ""
"The four summaries reproduce the core economic account and its directional "
"bridge:"
msgstr "四份摘要复现核心经济账户及其方向性桥梁："

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:369
#: fa61f1b7c129473bbf4ecba7194572ac
msgid "Question for Plan D"
msgstr "针对方案 D 的问题"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:369
#: 5298d2dfaef647049ac862d7b2fe7d85
msgid "Decision-relevant reading"
msgstr "与决策相关的解释"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:369
#: 1161e4ed235145bfbde37bc828dbc409
msgid "Minimum cost for $(3,2)$"
msgstr "为 $(3,2)$ 提供服务的最低成本"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:369
#: 35972f0179e542ad9a5462819987fb81
msgid "$7$; $CE=TE^I AE^C=(7/12)(1)$"
msgstr "$7$; $CE=TE^I AE^C=(7/12)(1)$"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:369
#: fdb188a126ff48df81cba616ce3326f2
msgid "The current service commitment could be delivered for 5 less"
msgstr "履行当前服务承诺可以少花 5"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:369
#: 0172dfcafdbf46468777a40206a5b0d7
msgid "Maximum revenue with at most 6 units of the resource"
msgstr "使用不超过 6 单位资源时的最大收益"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:369
#: 6c8093dddb844dbc8e1df8eff63b171c
msgid "$37$; $RE=TE^O AE^R=(13/22)(418/481)$"
msgstr "$37$; $RE=TE^O AE^R=(13/22)(418/481)$"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:369
#: ccb9f37f3aa144e4a371bedbff5a644c
msgid "The same resource envelope supports 18 more value units"
msgstr "同一资源限额可以多创造 18 单位价值"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:369
#: 2934c6f6fef34d489f7e4baa2210174e
msgid "$27$; gap $=20$"
msgstr "$27$; gap $=20$"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:369
#: af485b927aa24b0b962ac064fbeef11b
msgid "Joint adjustment favors Plan B over D"
msgstr "联合调整支持选择方案 B 而不是 D"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:369
#: 66ccbc6b4d424a5889523470414f02df
msgid "Price-valued declared programme"
msgstr "用价格评价的声明方案"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:369
#: 0569bb3c9d71485ca10094bf29ee0930
msgid "$\\nu=10$; $NI=2.0=1.6+0.4$"
msgstr "$\\nu=10$; $NI=2.0=1.6+0.4$"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:369
#: d95da6cea2b3478489941487dd3743be
msgid "The programme represents 16 of the 20-unit profit opportunity"
msgstr "该方案代表 20 单位利润机会中的 16"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:454
#: 353cb8163d9f4846b9233b392c970c6f
msgid ""
"Before any of these numbers becomes a management claim, the economic account"
" must reconcile with the benchmark operation. Minimum cost must equal the "
"input-price bill of the selected cost plan, maximum revenue must equal the "
"output value of the selected revenue plan, and maximum profit must equal "
"benchmark revenue minus benchmark cost. DEAPack verifies those links and "
"withholds an unreconciled result. This safeguard cannot make the prices or "
"the reference population economically credible; it establishes only that the"
" reported account follows from the declared model and benchmark."
msgstr ""
"在把这些数字变成管理主张之前，经济账户必须与标杆经营方案相协调。最低成本必须等于所选成本方案的投入价格账单；最大收益必须等于所选收益方案的产出价值；最大利润必须等于标杆收益减去标杆成本。DEAPack"
" 会核验这些联系，并拒绝发布无法协调的结果。这项保障不能使价格或参照总体在经济上自动可信；它只表明报告账户确实来自声明的模型与标杆。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:463
#: ad38770060fd481987ad71c6b95d5b21
msgid ""
"Headline values should be read with the associated benchmark activity, "
"peers, and slacks. A minimum-cost activity, a maximum-revenue activity, and "
"a profit-maximizing activity are different counterfactuals even when two of "
"them happen to select the same observed peer. A directional programme can "
"then be used to interpret part of the profit gap; it does not replace these "
"three decisions."
msgstr "解读首要数值时，应同时查看相应的标杆生产活动、活跃参照单元和松弛量。最低成本活动、最大收益活动和利润最大化活动是不同的反事实，即使其中两项碰巧选择了同一个观测参照单元。随后可以用方向性方案解释利润缺口的一部分；它不能取代这三种决策。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:469
#: f26c83458f0d43af8524119b6fd05262
msgid "Prices and technology form one empirical contract"
msgstr "价格与技术共同构成经验契约"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:471
#: 213bb4077112476890831cc2d189c637
msgid ""
"Economic DEA results are meaningful only when both sides of the comparison "
"are credible. Prices define the value account; the technology defines the "
"attainable alternatives."
msgstr "只有比较两侧都可信，经济 DEA 结果才有意义。价格定义价值账户，技术定义可实现替代方案。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:475
#: 6184623a25cd4ed2af05295458a48f66
msgid "Prices are observed valuations, not flexible DEA weights"
msgstr "价格是观测价值，不是可自由选择的 DEA 权重"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:477
#: 2e09c43eaea2400ba803820577d432f4
msgid ""
"The vectors $w$ and $p$ are wage rates, rental prices, tariffs, product "
"prices, reimbursements, or explicitly justified social values supplied by "
"the analyst. The study must also say whose valuation they represent. Market "
"prices may describe a firm's commercial opportunity, administered tariffs "
"may describe a regulator's payment regime, and social values may express a "
"public decision-maker's priorities; none is automatically a measure of "
"social welfare. These observed valuations are not the endogenous multiplier "
"weights through which a conventional DEA model values each unit favorably. A"
" technically efficient unit can still be far from the least-cost or maximum-"
"profit plan under the valuation regime it actually faces."
msgstr ""
"向量 $w$ 和 $p$ "
"可以是工资率、租赁价格、收费标准、产品价格、报销价格，或由分析者明确论证的社会价值。研究还必须说明它们代表谁的价值评价。市场价格可以描述企业的商业机会，行政收费标准可以描述监管支付制度，社会价值可以表达公共决策者的优先级；任何一种都不会自动成为社会福利的测度。这些观测价值不是传统"
" DEA 模型用来给予各单元最有利评价的内生乘数权重。一个技术有效单元在实际面对的价值制度下，仍可能远离最低成本或最大利润方案。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:487
#: cb11a71894564c56b5dc918bdea661f8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Weight-restricted DEA lies between unrestricted self-valuation and an "
"observed-price account. An authority may bound relative multipliers to "
"express defensible service priorities or production trade-offs, but those "
"bounds remain declared value judgements; they do not become wages, tariffs, "
"or market prices. The resulting assessment therefore belongs to its parent "
"technical-efficiency family and must not be labelled cost, revenue, or "
"profit efficiency merely because its multipliers are restricted "
"{cite:p}`allen1997,cooper2011handbook`."
msgstr ""
"权重受限 DEA "
"位于不受限的自我价值评价与观测价格账户之间。主管机构可以限制乘数相对值，以表达可辩护的服务优先级或生产权衡；但这些界限仍是明确声明的价值判断，并不会变成工资、收费标准或市场价格。因此，所得评价仍属于其母技术效率模型族，不能仅因乘数受到限制就标为成本、收益或利润效率"
" {cite:p}`allen1997,cooper2011handbook`。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:495
#: 4b8b423aaeb241e2b1b2c9a16b8b6d80
msgid ""
"Variable names and physical units must match their prices. If labor is "
"converted from hours to thousands of hours, the price must be converted from"
" currency per hour to currency per thousand hours so that $w^\\top x$ "
"remains unchanged. Monetary comparisons also require a common currency and "
"price base. Deflation and conversion belong in the study design, not in an "
"interpretation added after estimation."
msgstr ""
"变量名称和物理单位必须与价格匹配。如果把劳动从工时改为千工时，价格也必须从每工时货币单位改为每千工时货币单位，使 $w^\\top x$ "
"保持不变。货币比较还要求采用共同货币和价格基期。平减与换算应在研究设计中完成，不能在估计后才通过解释补上。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:501
#: 9aa86afea4014a0baa6f8f7e7ffbcc2d
msgid ""
"For the classical ratios used here, prices are finite and strictly positive."
" A zero or negative valuation may represent a subsidy, disposal liability, "
"bad output, or public service whose economic role needs to be modelled "
"explicitly. Replacing it by an arbitrary small positive number changes the "
"question rather than solving it."
msgstr "本章的经典比率要求价格有限且严格为正。零或负的价值可能代表补贴、处置负债、非合意产出，或需要明确建模其经济角色的公共服务。用任意小的正数替代它，并不是解决问题，而是改变问题。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:506
#: 392d18e0b5a9405cad3af09659955856
msgid ""
"Multiplying every input price by the same positive constant leaves cost "
"efficiency unchanged but rescales the cost gap; the analogous statement "
"holds for revenue. Multiplying both input and output prices by the same "
"constant rescales the profit gap and the value of a directional programme "
"together, leaving the programme-unit account unchanged. Changes in "
"*relative* prices are different: they can select a different input mix, "
"output portfolio, or profit-maximizing operation."
msgstr "所有投入价格同乘一个正常数，不改变成本效率，但会缩放成本缺口；收益也有对应性质。投入与产出价格同时乘同一个常数，会一起缩放利润缺口和一单位方向性方案的价值，从而保持方案单位账户不变。*相对*价格变化则不同：它可能选择新的投入组合、产出组合或利润最大化经营方案。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:513
#: 99cddd97922d47a78eebdca3dd9ecf75
msgid ""
"Common prices compare organizations under one valuation regime, as in a "
"national tariff. Observation-specific prices evaluate each organization "
"under its own wage, procurement, or reimbursement conditions. Both can be "
"legitimate, but the latter mixes production opportunities with different "
"local price environments and should not be presented as a common-price "
"league table."
msgstr "共同价格按照同一种价值制度比较组织，例如全国统一收费标准。观测特定价格则按照各组织自身的工资、采购或报销条件评价。两者都可能合理，但后者把生产机会与不同的地方价格环境混合起来，不应报告成共同价格排行榜。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:519
#: 161bbc6b20944e6392c902b10373df12
msgid "The opportunity set must match the decision"
msgstr "生产机会集合必须与决策匹配"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:521
#: 95dcee6a1dfd4bc2a9cffd27dc087ddf
msgid ""
"All components of any technical--economic decomposition must use the same "
"observations, variables, returns to scale, disposability assumptions, and "
"reference policy. Combining VRS economic efficiency with a CRS technical "
"component divides results from different opportunity sets and has no stable "
"economic meaning."
msgstr ""
"任何技术—经济分解的所有分量都必须使用相同观测、变量、规模报酬、可处置性假设和参照政策。把 VRS 经济效率与 CRS "
"技术分量结合，是在用不同生产机会集合的结果相除，没有稳定的经济含义。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:526
#: d75c7b3a97d2470393c49cfa7d275795
msgid ""
"The familiar bounds $CE\\le1$, $RE\\le1$, and nonnegative gaps also rely on "
"the observed plan being feasible in the reference technology. An external, "
"historical, or leave-group-out frontier may not envelop the evaluated unit. "
"A ratio above one or a negative gap should then be read as evidence that the"
" unit lies beyond that benchmark, not forced back into the usual range."
msgstr ""
"熟悉的界限 $CE\\le1$、$RE\\le1$ "
"和非负缺口同样依赖观测方案在参照技术中可行。外部、历史或留组外前沿可能不包络被评价单元。此时，比率大于 1 "
"或缺口为负，应理解为该单元超出了这一标杆，而不能强行压回通常范围。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:532
#: 2a79b28ddb0b4b7e82b30b21e66c1698
msgid ""
"Cost and revenue problems can be posed under CRS or VRS. Unconstrained CRS "
"profit maximization requires special care. If one feasible operation earns "
"positive profit, CRS permits it to be replicated indefinitely:"
msgstr "成本和收益问题都可以在 CRS 或 VRS 下提出。无约束 CRS 利润最大化需要特别谨慎。如果某个可行经营方案能够获得正利润，CRS 允许无限复制："

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:536
#: 099b3100a71a4b738c9dddc3d75a78a4
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"p^\\top(ty)-w^\\top(tx)\n"
"=t\\bigl(p^\\top y-w^\\top x\\bigr)\\longrightarrow\\infty\n"
"\\quad\\text{as }t\\to\\infty.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"p^\\top(ty)-w^\\top(tx)\n"
"=t\\bigl(p^\\top y-w^\\top x\\bigr)\\longrightarrow\\infty\n"
"\\quad\\text{当 }t\\to\\infty.\n"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:542
#: a1025a7718c544cca2bb73f9e47dbb82
msgid ""
"Unboundedness is then the correct economic conclusion. A finite CRS profit "
"benchmark requires capacity constraints, an equilibrium price condition, or "
"another explicit scale limit. Our worked price account and directional "
"bridge use VRS because its convexity condition bounds the operating scale."
msgstr ""
"此时，无界正是正确的经济结论。有限的 CRS 利润标杆需要产能约束、均衡价格条件或其他明确规模限制。本章示例的价格账户与方向性桥梁采用 "
"VRS，因为其凸性条件限制了经营规模。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:547
#: 4f08e7269c6f4f71a8c98f9c9c298b7a
msgid ""
"VRS does not automatically include the zero-activity plan. If every observed"
" plan makes a loss, the model selects the least-loss-making attainable "
"operation. That can be appropriate for a hospital or regulated utility with "
"a continuing-service obligation. If a firm can close in the long run, "
"inactivity, fixed commitments, exit costs, and minimum-service requirements "
"must be represented in the opportunity set. Shutdown is an economic choice, "
"not something to infer mechanically from a negative observed profit."
msgstr ""
"VRS "
"不会自动包含零生产活动。如果每个观测方案都亏损，模型会选择可实现方案中亏损最少者。对于负有持续服务义务的医院或受监管公用事业，这可能恰当。如果企业长期可以关闭，就必须在生产机会集合中表示停产、固定承诺、退出成本和最低服务要求。停业是经济选择，不能由负的观测利润机械推断。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:555
#: ec590d696f434f05a24333c9889ddc07
msgid "From a benchmark to a management conclusion"
msgstr "从标杆走向管理结论"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:557
#: b4bcf98b06c94d728d45b8f228247f14
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A scalar result is the beginning of an explanation, not the end. Radial "
"technical models preserve the observed mix during their proportional step "
"and can leave non-proportional savings or expansions. Such slacks qualify "
"any claim that the residual component is purely allocative "
"{cite:p}`pastor2022benchmarking,aparicio2023essential`."
msgstr ""
"标量结果是解释的起点，不是终点。径向技术模型在比例步骤中保持观测组合，并可能留下非比例节约或扩张。只要存在这些松弛量，就必须限定“剩余分量纯属配置因素”这一主张"
" {cite:p}`pastor2022benchmarking,aparicio2023essential`。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:562
#: 849ddfb6b1f0414891651c3db099e368
msgid ""
"The same economic optimum may also be attainable through several peer "
"combinations. The optimum value can therefore be well determined while the "
"operating target is not unique. If implementation depends on a particular "
"target, the study should examine alternative optima, transition costs, and "
"organizational constraints rather than present one selected activity as the "
"only recommendation."
msgstr "同一个经济最优值也可能由多个活跃参照单元组合实现。因此，最优值可以非常确定，而经营目标并不唯一。如果实施取决于具体目标，研究应考察其他最优方案、转型成本和组织约束，而不能把一个所选生产活动当作唯一建议。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:568
#: eb6211a4edc6487ba1c8123e99783c07
msgid ""
"The models support disciplined counterfactual statements: under the recorded"
" prices and VRS comparison technology, D could meet its service commitment "
"for 5 less, earn 18 more from its current resource envelope, or gain 20 in "
"profit through joint adjustment. They do not establish that management "
"caused the gaps or that the peer plan can be copied without adaptation. Case"
" mix, quality, regulation, demand, geography, and omitted resources can all "
"matter."
msgstr ""
"这些模型支持规范的反事实表述：在记录价格和 VRS 比较技术下，D 可以少花 5 来履行服务承诺，在当前资源限额内多获得 18 "
"收益，或通过联合调整多获得 20 "
"利润。它们不能说明缺口由管理造成，也不能说明参照方案无需调整即可照搬。病例结构、质量、监管、需求、地理和遗漏资源都可能影响结果。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:575
#: 490130b549e1498aa059b6b5f1852b7b
msgid "A responsible analysis therefore proceeds in this order:"
msgstr "因此，负责任的分析应按以下次序进行："

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:577
#: 21453f9290704391a458f0319a6c4cec
msgid "state the operational commitment and decision horizon;"
msgstr "说明经营承诺与决策期限；"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:578
#: b285ca068a094b078970ee36be9b7341
msgid "define the technology and comparison set;"
msgstr "定义技术和比较集合；"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:579
#: a276643f15f34c62a96d926916e44179
msgid "document price meanings, units, provenance, and variation across units;"
msgstr "记录价格含义、单位、来源及其在不同单元间的变化；"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:580
#: 73a30a41184047709af1cc3f13f5183b
msgid "choose the cost, revenue, or profit question that matches the commitment;"
msgstr "选择与承诺匹配的成本、收益或利润问题；"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:581
#: b9640b0c817345f89473115065371c4e
msgid ""
"if useful, declare a directional programme for interpreting part of a profit"
" gap;"
msgstr "如果有用，声明一套方向性方案，用来解释利润缺口的一部分；"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:582
#: d797396af86147d1bbd84743421cb720
msgid "interpret the value alongside the benchmark activity, peers, and slacks; and"
msgstr "结合标杆生产活动、活跃参照单元和松弛量解释价值；"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:583
#: 5ee82e50f9854ff18c40e8ec25ab7cef
msgid "investigate constraints and adjustment costs that are absent from the model."
msgstr "调查模型未包含的约束和调整成本。"

#: ../../chapters/02-classical/economic-efficiency-under-prices.md:585
#: 96e22ddbbcce45c49a2fbf1f99d92490
msgid ""
"There is no virtue in estimating every member of the family when only one "
"counterfactual is credible. The central distinction is simple: cost "
"efficiency values resource adjustment while protecting outputs; revenue "
"efficiency values output adjustment while protecting inputs; and the profit "
"gap values joint adjustment. A declared directional programme may illuminate"
" part of that gap, but it is subordinate to the economic decision. Once the "
"commitment is explicit, each result has a clear economic meaning rather than"
" being merely another score attached to a frontier."
msgstr "当只有一个反事实可信时，没有必要估计模型族的每个成员。核心区别很简单：成本效率在保障产出时评价资源调整，收益效率在保障投入时评价产出调整，利润缺口则评价联合调整。声明的方向性方案可以阐明利润缺口的一部分，但从属于经济决策。一旦承诺明确，每项结果都有清楚的经济含义，而不只是附在前沿上的另一个得分。"

